# Pulsar: a neutron star that charges, then fires an expanding shockwave ring
# which SHOVES the ship outward instead of killing it.
#
# The cycle is fixed (hazard.cpp): PULSAR_CHARGE_MS 2400 then PULSAR_EXPAND_MS
# 1100 out to PULSAR_MAX_RADIUS 520. So `sim` skips most of the first charge
# and the window covers the fire, the full expansion and the shove after it —
# an untimed window catches nothing but a blinking star, which is what the
# first cut of this scene did.
# The ship sits ~370 units out with NO thrust held: every bit of movement you
# see is the wave doing it.
seed 61
sim 1900
frames 110
fps 30
size 960 540
clear
hud off
camera fixed
zoom 62
ship 250 0 0
hazard pulsar -120 0
asteroid 520 340 r=60
asteroid -480 -300 r=55
